            </note>
            <note corresp="#d52-f4" n="1" xml:id="d52-f4-content">
                <p>For final arrangements regarding these points see the agreement of Nov, 11, 1918,
                        <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg103">p. 103</ref>.</p>
            </note>
